From b4ee7c3be4d3f9231ff58c839ad1fa85a185542f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mphuongth <mphuongth@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 18 Apr 2026 11:54:47 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] feat(brand): redesign Allocate logo as navy+emerald
 allocation donut

Replaces the purple-gradient "A" placeholder with a segmented-donut mark
that literally pictures budget allocation. Same output filenames so
existing <link> tags and manifest entries keep working without changes.

- Rewrite scripts/generate-icons.mjs with parameterized donut geometry
  (palette, segment shares, and sizes all centralized as constants)
- Emit public/allocate-icon.svg and allocate-icon-transparent.svg as
  crisp vector masters alongside the raster icon set
- Declare sharp in package.json (previously imported but undeclared)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 package-lock.json                    |  15 +++-
 package.json                         |   1 +
 public/allocate-icon-transparent.svg |   1 +
 public/allocate-icon.svg             |   6 ++
 public/apple-touch-icon.png          | Bin 4064 -> 6529 bytes
 public/favicon-32.png                | Bin 725 -> 1137 bytes
 public/icon-192.png                  | Bin 4479 -> 6968 bytes
 public/icon-512.png                  | Bin 17759 -> 22969 bytes
 scripts/generate-icons.mjs           | 119 +++++++++++++++++++++++----
 9 files changed, 121 insertions(+), 21 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 public/allocate-icon-transparent.svg
 create mode 100644 public/allocate-icon.svg

